# Localized Reports & PDF Fixes Implementation Plan

This plan addresses several critical issues in the report generation and UI: the lack of Unicode support in PDFs (Tamil fonts appearing as squares), the need for fully localized summaries, dual-language transcripts, and fixing the quiz component.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Backend: PDF Generation & Localization

#### [MODIFY] [pdf_service.py](file:///c:/My%20Projects/Video_summara/backend/app/services/pdf_service.py)
- **Replace `xhtml2pdf` with `weasyprint`**: WeasyPrint has much better support for CSS3 and Unicode fonts.
- **Font Integration**: Ensure the system has a Tamil-compatible font (like Noto Sans Tamil) or embed a font to fix the "blank squares" issue.
- **Group Visual Highlights**: Update the HTML template to display images in a grid/grouped format rather than separate full-width slides.

#### [MODIFY] [summarizer_service.py](file:///c:/My%20Projects/Video_summara/backend/app/services/summarizer_service.py)
- **Direct Translation**: Update [translate_report_async](file:///c:/My%20Projects/Video_summara/backend/app/services/summarizer_service.py#180-196) to ensure it outputs the final report strictly in the target language (Tamil/Hindi etc.) for the primary view.
- **Dual Transcript Payload**: Ensure both the original and translated transcripts are saved to the artifacts.

#### [MODIFY] [tasks.py](file:///c:/My%20Projects/Video_summara/backend/app/api/routers/tasks.py)
- **Artifact Update**: Update [process_video_task](file:///c:/My%20Projects/Video_summara/backend/core_processor.py#111-178) to store both `translated_transcript` and `raw_transcript` in Supabase.

### 2. Frontend: UI & Interaction

#### [MODIFY] [ReportView.jsx](file:///c:/My%20Projects/Video_summara/frontend/src/pages/ReportView.jsx)
- **Dual-Language Transcript Switch**: 
    - Implement a badge-style toggle inside the Transcript card to switch between "Original" and "Translated (English)".
- **Quiz Fixes**:
    - Fix variable mapping (`q.question` vs `q.q`) so questions display correctly.
    - Implement interactive "Correct/Incorrect" feedback with animations when an option is selected.
    - Ensure cards are responsive.
- **Visuals Grouping**:
    - Refine the visuals tab to group images into a card-based layout instead of single slides.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run backend processing for a Tamil YouTube video and verify the generated PDF contains actual Tamil characters.
- Check Supabase [task_artifacts](file:///c:/My%20Projects/Video_summara/backend/app/api/routers/tasks.py#85-95) table for `translated_transcript` column.

### Manual Verification
- Verify the "Original" vs "English" toggle in the report UI.
- Test the interactive quiz: select a wrong answer (red highlight) and a correct answer (green highlight).
- Check the grouped visuals in the report view.
